	"library": "shadcn",
	"category": "developer",
	"description": "Commit row in the shadcn/ui style — monospace short-hash chip, subject line with author and time caption, +/− diff counters in the library's success and danger inks, and a five-square churn strip. Interactive controls and editable values; saves private Things through an Action.",
